   "text": "An event study asks what a price (or a strategy) does around a specific date, compared with what it normally does given the market. Day 0 is the event. The grey baseline is learned from the ~200 days before the window, then the extra return ( abnormal return ) is added up day by day ( CAR ). Stress periods above show what happened inside a named episode; this shows what the strategy does around a date, relative to the benchmark."
