  {
   "kind": "heading",
   "text": "Fund review"
  },
  {
   "kind": "note",
   "text": "Does a fund or security earn its place? It is compared with a beta-matched replica : beta x a market factor + (1 - beta) x the risk-free series, rebalanced monthly. If the product cannot beat that mix after fees, the replica gives the same exposure for a few basis points. The review also covers stress episodes, crash behaviour, a portfolio funding test, fees and taxes, and ends with a verdict from three explicit checks. Every column of the file is available here, whatever the selection above."
  },
